      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Claude Monet, a demanding guest complains about his food and demands to see the chef. A demanding guest sits in the restaurant and waits for someone to assist him. He becomes increasingly annoyed by the lack of attention and decides to call a waiter. Let's listen closely to the conversation in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Девушка, можно вас?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Да, я вас слушаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "У нас проблема с заказом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
